"{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"id\":76666,\"name\":\"ドラゴンボール\",\"slug\":\"dragon-ball\",\"image\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/76666-16.jpg\",\"nameTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"hun\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"srp\",\"hrv\",\"jpn\",\"eus\",\"pt\",\"kor\",\"zho\",\"pol\",\"cat\",\"ara\",\"dan\",\"tur\",\"glg\"],\"overviewTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"hun\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"srp\",\"hrv\",\"jpn\",\"eus\",\"pt\",\"kor\",\"zho\",\"pol\",\"cat\",\"ara\",\"dan\",\"tur\",\"glg\"],\"aliases\":[{\"language\":\"deu\",\"name\":\"Dragonball\"},{\"language\":\"zho\",\"name\":\"龙珠\"},{\"language\":\"ara\",\"name\":\"دراغون بول (1986)\"},{\"language\":\"tur\",\"name\":\"Dragon Ball\"},{\"language\":\"tur\",\"name\":\"Dragonball\"},{\"language\":\"tur\",\"name\":\"Dragon Ball (1986)\"},{\"language\":\"spa\",\"name\":\"Bola de Drac\"},{\"language\":\"spa\",\"name\":\"Bola de Dragón\"},{\"language\":\"spa\",\"name\":\"Dragon Ball Latino\"},{\"language\":\"eng\",\"name\":\"Dragonball\"},{\"language\":\"eng\",\"name\":\"Dragon Ball (1986)\"}],\"firstAired\":\"1986-02-26\",\"lastAired\":\"1989-04-19\",\"nextAired\":\"\",\"score\":452914,\"status\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Ended\",\"recordType\":\"series\",\"keepUpdated\":false},\"originalCountry\":\"jpn\",\"originalLanguage\":\"jpn\",\"defaultSeasonType\":1,\"isOrderRandomized\":false,\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-08-02 09:09:46\",\"averageRuntime\":25,\"episodes\":[{\"id\":375376,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Curse of the Blood Rubies\",\"aired\":\"1986-12-20\",\"runtime\":50,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Deep within the core of the Earth a fire rages. Within the heart of this fire dwells the Eternal Dragon, a magical beast of limitless power that can be summoned from his fiery lair only when the seven magic Dragon Balls -- now scattered over the face of the Earth -- are found and brought together. When the seven magic Dragon Balls are united, the Eternal Dragon will appear before the adventurer who brought them together and grant that person a single wish. Then, once more the balls will be scattered to the four winds, and the dragon beast will return to his fiery lair until another brave or foolish soul rediscovers the balls and tries to bring them together again.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/375376.jpg\",\"imageType\":11,\"isMovie\":1,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":0,\"seasonNumber\":0,\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-05-23 12:57:03\",\"finaleType\":null,\"airsBeforeSeason\":3,\"airsBeforeEpisode\":16,\"year\":\"1986\",\"linkedMovie\":5301},{\"id\":375377,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Sleeping Princess in Devil's Castle\",\"aired\":\"1987-07-18\",\"runtime\":45,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Krilin travel to Master Roshi's island, hoping to train from the renowned martial arts master. Before he will train either, they must prove they're worthy. As a test, Master Roshi sends them to Devil's Hand, where legend has it that there is a sleeping princess. The one who can bring this legendary lady to Master Roshi will be worthy of training. But others have their eye on the \\\"Sleeping Princess\\\". A determined Launch has set out to bring back the royal gem for her own monetary reasons. Also, Bulma, Yamcha, Puar and Oolong join in the adventure wen they try to find Goku. Surprises are in store for everyone as the Devil's Hand is home for the sinister Lucifer, a vampire with diabolical plans to destroy the Earth! And to make matters worse, he's backed by a league of ferocious ogers! Can Goku and the gang survive Devil's Hand? Or is the Earth doomed…\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/375377.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":1,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":0,\"seasonNumber\":0,\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-05-23 12:57:13\",\"finaleType\":null,\"airsBeforeSeason\":4,\"airsBeforeEpisode\":3,\"year\":\"1987\",\"linkedMovie\":4871},{\"id\":375378,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Mystical Adventure\",\"aired\":\"1988-07-09\",\"runtime\":48,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Krillin have completed their training under the mystical Master Roshi. Now the duo is off to test their newly acquired skills at a prestigious martial arts tournament sponsored by the young emperor Chiaotzu. The winner of the tournament is said to get an audience with the Emperor, and a wish for anything they want! But sinister plans are underway beneath the facade of the elaborate tournament. The young emperor's wife has been kidnapped! The emperor's right - hand man, Master Shen, has convinced him the Dragon Balls must be gathered to wish her back. But secretly, he and his henchman Master Tao plan to overthrow the Emperor, and with the help of the Dragon Balls, rule the kingdom themselves! And to complicate matters even more, Bulma and the gang are desperately searching for the Dragon Balls as well. As the tournament begins, the action all comes together. Get ready for a wild, crazy ride of comedy and excitement on a magical…MYSTICAL ADVENTURE!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/375378.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":1,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":0,\"seasonNumber\":0,\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-05-23 12:56:00\",\"finaleType\":null,\"airsBeforeSeason\":5,\"airsBeforeEpisode\":18,\"year\":\"1988\",\"linkedMovie\":10111},{\"id\":375379,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Path to Power\",\"aired\":\"1996-03-02\",\"runtime\":80,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"What happens when an adventure thirsty girl named Bulma runs across and nearly runs over a bizarre young boy named Goku?? They find themselves thrust into an adventure that will last a lifetime! Together they set out to recover the mystical Dragon Balls, artifacts of incredible power! Legend says that whomever collects all seven Dragon Balls can call forth the awesome Eternal Dragon, a powerful creature that will grant whatever wish their heart desires!But there is another interested party eager to control the power of the Dragon Balls. They are known as the Red Ribbon Army, and they will stop at nothing to use the Dragon Balls to achieve their wish of total world domination. Along the way Goku will find out that the greatest power of all lies within himself. This is where the legend begins.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/375379.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":1,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":0,\"seasonNumber\":0,\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-05-23 12:54:59\",\"finaleType\":null,\"airsAfterSeason\":6,\"year\":\"1996\",\"linkedMovie\":7033},{\"id\":4185378,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Fire Brigade\",\"aired\":\"1988-06-01\",\"runtime\":11,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's Fire Brigade (悟空の消防隊, Gokuu no Shoubou-tai) is a 1988 public service video aired in Japan about Fire Safety. This video features the main characters having jobs as fire fighters, and Bulma living in a new apartment with Scratch instead of in the Capsule Corporation building.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/4185378.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":1,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":0,\"seasonNumber\":0,\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-05-23 13:04:18\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\",\"linkedMovie\":91594},{\"id\":4185381,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Traffic Safety\",\"aired\":\"1988-06-01\",\"runtime\":15,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's Traffic Safety (悟空の交通安全, Gokuu no Koutsuu Anzen) is a 1988 public service video that aired in Japan that promoted Traffic Safety. It was aired on TV between shows as a public service announcement and distributed to schools as a safety demonstration video.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/4185381.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":1,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":0,\"seasonNumber\":0,\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-05-23 12:52:34\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1988\",\"linkedMovie\":35940},{\"id\":206679,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Secret of the Dragon Balls\",\"aired\":\"1986-02-26\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku, an orphan living in the mountains, is out fishing when he meets Bulma, a young girl searching for the seven Dragon Balls, which, when gathered together, grant a wish. Goku's grandpa gave him the four-star Dragon Ball before he died. Needing this ball for her collection, already possessing two balls, Bulma decides to let Goku join her search. They take off on a motorcycle, but Bulma is suddenly grabbed by a giant flying dinosaur. Goku hits the monster with his power pole and rescues Bulma.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206679.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":1,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:50:42\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206680,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Emperor's Quest\",\"aired\":\"1986-03-05\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Bulma set up a shelter to sleep in. At night, Goku goes out looking for some food. He sees a ship fly overhead, and, thinking that it's a bird, goes running after it. The ship belongs to Mai and Shu, who are servants of Emperor Pilaf. The Emperor is also looking for the Dragon Balls. Goku saves them from wolves, and heads back. In the morning,he finds a giant turtle who is looking for the sea. Goku volunteers to take him there, so he picks up the turtle on his back and begins running, with Bulma following on her motorcycle.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206680.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":2,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:50:46\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206681,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Nimbus Cloud of Roshi\",\"aired\":\"1986-03-12\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"On their way to the sea, Goku and Bulma run into a Bear Thief that tries to eat the turtle. Goku makes short work of him, and they continue on their way. When they arrive at the shore, the turtle tells them to wait for him. When he comes back, a man is riding on his back. The man is Master Roshi, and as a reward for helping his turtle, he gives Goku his flying Nimbus Cloud. Roshi himself can't ride the cloud, because only good and pure people can. Bulma can't ride it either, but Goku can. Roshi also gives Bulma the three-star Dragon Ball, not knowing what it is. When Master Roshi returns to his island, he finds Emperor Pilaf and his two henchmen searching his house for the Dragon Ball. After he tells them that he gave it away, the three leave his island.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206681.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":3,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:50:50\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206682,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Oolong the Terrible\",\"aired\":\"1986-03-19\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The dragon radar leads Goku and Bulma into a remote village. They find that the village is being terrorized by a shapeshifter named Oolong. An old woman in this village has the six-star Dragon Ball, and she agrees to give it to them if they drive Oolong away from their village. Oolong wants to marry a girl in the village, so Goku dresses up like her to trick Oolong. When Oolong discovers this, he gets very angry. To protect his identity, he reverts back into his original state after he transformed and runs away from the village. Goku follows, and eventually catches him. With the village saved, the old woman gives them the six-star ball.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206682.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":4,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:50:55\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206683,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Yamcha the Desert Bandit\",\"aired\":\"1986-03-26\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Bulma and Goku continue their quest for the Dragon Balls with Oolong (Bulma brought him along thinking his shape-shifting abilities might come in handy). But the next Dragon Ball lies beyond the Diablo Desert. Oolong is terrified, for he knows that the Diablo Desert is home to Yamcha, a fearsome bandit who possesses the awesome power of the Wolf's Fang Fist. Can our friends make it through the desert to their destination?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206683.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":5,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:00\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206684,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Keep an Eye on the Dragon Balls\",\"aired\":\"1986-04-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"While Bulma, Goku and Oolong recover from the ordeal of acquiring five Dragon Balls, Yamcha and Puar try to steal them out from under their noses so that Yamcha can obtain his own grandiose goal. But they're not the only ones after the Dragon Balls! Oolong wouldn't mind having the Dragon Balls, and Emperor Pilaf's henchmen are closing in as well.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206684.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":6,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:04\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206685,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Ox-King on Fire Mountain\",\"aired\":\"1986-04-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The search for the sixth Dragon Ball leads the Dragon Ball Team to Fire Mountain, home of the dreaded Ox-King. They arrive at the base of the mountain, but the scorching Eternal Flames prevent them from reaching the castle at the summit and the Dragon Ball within. To make matters worse, Ox-King appears to ward off the intruders. Will our heroes be able to capture the sixth Dragon Ball?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206685.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":7,\"absoluteNumber\":7,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:08\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206686,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Kamehameha Wave\",\"aired\":\"1986-04-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Master Roshi, who appears to be a wise but feeble old man, reveals that he is a master of the \\\"Kamehameha\\\" an ancient and formidable force. The power, which he channels through his hands, creates a wave of tremendous destruction that can topple mountains.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206686.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":8,\"absoluteNumber\":8,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:12\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206687,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Boss Rabbit's Magic Touch\",\"aired\":\"1986-04-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Bulma and Goku's search for the Dragon Balls takes them to a remote village that is being terrorized by a villainous gang, the Rabbits. Before long, Goku and the Dragon Ball Team come face to face with two of the Rabbits, and Goku must fight to protect his friends. Can he protect them from the surprises Monster Carrot has in store for them?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206687.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":9,\"absoluteNumber\":9,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:17\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206688,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Dragon Balls are Stolen!\",\"aired\":\"1986-04-30\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The Dragon Ball Team races toward the seventh Dragon Ball. Little do they know that their enemies await them. Can Emperor Pilaf be stopped from gathering the last of the Dragon Balls and making his evil wish?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206688.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":10,\"absoluteNumber\":10,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:21\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206689,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Penalty is Pinball\",\"aired\":\"1986-05-07\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The Dragon Ball Team escapes their prison to search for Pilaf and the Dragon Balls. Their freedom is short-lived, however, for the Dragon Ball Team stumbles into another one of Pilaf's treacherous traps: a giant pinball machine! The team runs a desperate race through the maze of corridors. What hope can be left for the Dragon Ball Team as they try to stop Pilaf from gaining his evil wish to rule the Earth?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206689.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":11,\"absoluteNumber\":11,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:25\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206690,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"A Wish to the Eternal Dragon\",\"aired\":\"1986-05-14\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Just as Emperor Pilaf is about to make his wish, Goku leads the others in a successful escape attempt. Are they in time to prevent the Emperor from seizing control of the world? And just what does happen when Goku sees the full moon?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206690.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":12,\"absoluteNumber\":12,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:29\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":206691,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Legend of Goku\",\"aired\":\"1986-05-21\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku is exposed to a full moon. Transforming into a huge, alien gorilla, Goku goes on a rampage, attacking friends and foes alike. Can Bulma, Yamcha, and Puar return Goku to his normal self without hurting him and while also avoiding Emperor Pilaf's army?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206691.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":13,\"absoluteNumber\":13,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Emperor Pilaf Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:34\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210301,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Rival\",\"aired\":\"1986-05-28\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku stops by his house to gather his things, then heads towards Master Roshi's island. When he arrives, Master Roshi tells him that he will only train him if he brings him a girlfriend. Goku brings back a big ugly-looking girl but Master Roshi wanted a beautiful girl. So Goku got a mermaid, but it didn't go well. Suddenly, a small boy named Krillin paddles ashore on a boat and requests training from Master Roshi. With the help of a bribe, Master Roshi agrees to train him. He sends Goku and Krillin into the city to find him another girl. Meanwhile, Yamcha's ship crashed, so he, Bulma, Puar, and Oolong are forced to walk through the desert.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210301.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":14,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:40\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210311,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Look Out for Launch!\",\"aired\":\"1986-06-04\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Because Krillin can't sit on the Nimbus Cloud, he is forced to cling to Goku's back during their search for a girl. They find a girl being attacked by two men. Goku beats up these two guys, and they bring the girl back to Master Roshi's island. Unknown to either of them, the girl, Launch, was actually being arrested when they found her. When she sneezes, she turns into a mean, aggressive, blonde criminal. Back on the island, Roshi likes Launch so much that he agrees to take her on as a student, along with Goku and Krillin. Launch sneezes, and then takes out a machine gun and shoots at the three boys. After another sneeze, everything is back to normal.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210311.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":15,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:45\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210321,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Find That Stone\",\"aired\":\"1986-06-11\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Master Roshi packs up his house in a dyno capsule, and the four of them head to a bigger island. Master Roshi tests the boys' speed by timing them in a 100 meter dash. Krillin goes first, and runs the distance in 10.4 seconds. Goku's time is 11 seconds, but after he takes off his old, beat-up shoes, he runs it in 8 seconds. Master Roshi dazzles them by running it in 5.6 seconds. Then he gives them their final test for the day. He makes a mark on a stone, then throws it into the woods, telling them to find it; the loser must go without dinner for the night. Krillin tries to fool Master Roshi with a stone of his own, but Roshi sees through the lie. Goku finds the stone, but Krillin steals it and runs away. Goku catches up, and the two of them fight. Goku wins, so Krillin throws a decoy stone back into the woods, and Goku runs after it, thinking it's the real one. Krillin takes the real stone back to Master Roshi. However, it ultimately turns out to be a pyrrhic victory for Krillin, as Launch made pufferfish for dinner and failed to properly prepare it.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210321.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":16,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:49\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210331,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Milk Delivery\",\"aired\":\"1986-06-18\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Master Roshi wakes the boys up early to begin their training. Their job is to deliver milk, but there are several miles between each house. After several exhausting runs, they are made to climb a mountain to deliver milk to the monk at the top. While at the top, Master Roshi tells them that in eight months, they will be competing in the 21st World Martial Arts Tournament. This encouraging thought is enough to drive Goku and Krillin through the end of their milk delivery. Once the delivery ends, Master Roshi tells them that they will be delivering milk every day until the tournament. The boys are shocked to find out that the milk delivery was only their early morning training, and that they have much more to do every day. Meanwhile, Yamcha is also training for the World Martial Arts Tournament.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210331.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":17,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:53\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210341,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Turtle Hermit Way\",\"aired\":\"1986-06-25\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The boys continue their workout by plowing an entire field with their hands. After a quick breakfast, they head over to a construction site. Here, they dig holes and haul equipment. Their speed dazzles the foreman. They eat lunch and then take a nap. Goku is getting impatient, and wants to learn fighting moves, but Master Roshi says he won't teach them fighting moves until their bodies are in the proper condition. Their next task is to swim ten laps on a lake while they're being chased by sharks. Then Master Roshi ties them to a tree and makes them dodge angry bees. At the end of the day's training, Master Roshi tells them they will be doing the same thing every day for the next eight months, but with 50 lb. turtle shells on their backs.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210341.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":18,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:51:57\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210351,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Tournament Begins\",\"aired\":\"1986-07-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"After several months of training, the boys are anxious to learn fighting techniques. Master Roshi tells them that he has no technique to teach them. The whole point of turtle hermit training is to get your body in superhuman condition. He says fighting is just the expression of your power. Then he gives them 100 lb. turtle shells to wear from now on. After a couple more months, the day before the tournament finally arrives. After everyone checks in, Yamcha, Bulma, Oolong, and Puar meet up with Goku. The next morning, Master Roshi gives Goku and Krillin fighting uniforms to wear.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210351.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":19,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:02\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210361,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Elimination Round\",\"aired\":\"1986-07-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The preliminary rounds are divided into four sections, with the top two from each section going on to the finals. Goku and Krillin are drawn into the same section, but are on opposite ends, so they won't have to fight each other. Goku's first match is against a giant, but he is able to knock him out of the ring with only a slight tap to the leg. Krillin's first opponent is an enemy from his old martial arts school. He kicks his opponent so hard that he breaks a hole in the wall. Bulma, Oolong, and Puar are able to watch the matches through this hole. At the end of the day, Goku, Krillin, and Yamcha all advance to the final round of the World Martial Arts Tournament.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210361.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":7,\"absoluteNumber\":20,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:07\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210371,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Smells Like Trouble\",\"aired\":\"1986-07-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Krillin meet up with Bulma, Oolong, and Puar before the finals start. Master Roshi arrives, saying that he missed the preliminaries because of a long line in the bathroom. When the contestants are called to the arena, Goku and Krillin leave, and Master Roshi mysteriously disappears. They draw numbers to set the quarterfinal matches. Krillin is in the first match against Bacterian, a giant whose stench is paralyzing. Yamcha is in the second match against Jackie Chun, and Goku is in the fourth match. The first match starts, and right away Krillin is paralyzed by Bacterian's stench. Just when it looks like he's going to lose, Goku reminds him that he doesn't have a nose, and Krillin is able to get up and give Bacterian a taste of his own medicine. Krillin moves on to the semifinals.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210371.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":8,\"absoluteNumber\":21,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:11\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210381,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Quarter Finals Begin\",\"aired\":\"1986-07-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The second match begins. Yamcha tries his best moves against Jackie Chun, but he can't even land a punch. The old man is far too quick for him. The fight ends when Jackie Chun pushes Yamcha out of the ring with his energy. The third match between Nam and Ranfan begins. Nam is fighting for prize money to buy water for his village. Nam hits her and she starts to cry, but the crying is just an act. She takes advantage of this and quickly attacks. When Nam is able to defend her attacks easily, she takes off her clothes to distract him. Jackie Chun begins hooting wildly, and Yamcha recognizes this laughter as Master Roshi's. He realizes that Jackie Chun is Roshi. Nam closes his eyes and is able to beat Ranfan.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210381.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":9,\"absoluteNumber\":22,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:15\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210391,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Monster Beast Giran\",\"aired\":\"1986-07-30\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's match is postponed by rain. While they're waiting for the weather to clear up, they relax in the bar. Giran, Goku's opponent, comes in and starts causing trouble. Yamcha warns Goku that Giran has been known to cheat. When the match finally starts, Giran tricks Goku into dropping his guard, then punches him. Goku responds with a furious attack and throws Giran out of the ring. Giran reveals that he can fly, and he lands safely back in bounds. He then spits rock-hard gum onto Goku, paralyzing him. He throws Goku out of the ring, but Goku calls the flying Nimbus Cloud to save him. Just as Giran is about to punch Goku, his tail grows back and he dodges the punch. Since he is stronger with his tail, he is now able to break the gum. Shocked at this incredible display of strength, Giran forfeits the match.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210391.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":10,\"absoluteNumber\":23,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:19\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210401,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Krillin's Frantic Attack!\",\"aired\":\"1986-08-06\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The first semifinal begins. Unfortunately, Jackie Chun's punches are too fast for Krillin to see. He attacks Jackie Chun, and after a brief instant, they fly away from each other. The announcer asks them to slowly reenact what happened. Jackie Chun tried to kick Krillin, but he dodged it and then tried to land a punch, but Jackie spit at him. Krillin countered this with his own spit. Then they played janken, which was just a distraction, allowing Jackie to kick Krillin in the face. After the reenactment, Krillin distracts Jackie with a pair of panties, then kicks him far out of the ring. Jackie uses a Kamehameha wave to blast himself back into the ring. Then he uses the after-image technique to distract Krillin, allowing him to land a powerful kick, which knocks Krillin out. After the match, Yamcha, thinking that Jackie Chun is Master Roshi, tries to pull his wig off, but can't. Even though it seems like Jackie Chun is Master Roshi, no one can prove it.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210401.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":11,\"absoluteNumber\":24,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:23\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210411,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Danger From Above\",\"aired\":\"1986-08-13\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku starts his semifinal match against Nam. He uses a tornado attack to push Nam out of the ring, but gets too dizzy before he can finish it. Nam then uses his aerial attack, which is supposed to leave the victim unconscious. Goku is somehow able to stand up afterwards, and jumps up in the air just like Nam. Once Nam lands, Goku kicks him out of the ring. Afterwards, Nam packs up to leave, but Jackie Chun stops him. He gives him a dyno capsule that can be used for storage. Nam asks Jackie how he knew about his water problem, and Jackie says that he read his mind. Nam realizes that Jackie Chun is Master Roshi, but Jackie keeps him quiet. He explains that he is fighting undercover to beat Goku and Krillin. He doesn't want them to know that they're already the strongest in the world. Nam then does Jackie a favor by dressing up like Master Roshi and standing in the crowd. Yamcha sees him, and no longer thinks that Jackie Chun is Master Roshi.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210411.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":12,\"absoluteNumber\":25,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:28\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210421,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Grand Finals\",\"aired\":\"1986-08-20\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The final match begins. Goku jumps up in the air, but Jackie Chun sees it coming and kicks him out of the ring. Everyone thinks that Jackie has won, but Goku flies back into the ring by spinning his tail like helicopter blades. Jackie challenges Goku to use the Kamehameha wave, and to his great surprise, Goku can do it just as well as he can. Jackie uses a double after-image to fool Goku. Goku counters with a triple after-image. Jackie then begins staggering wildly around the ring. With his unpredictable movements, he begins beating up Goku. Yamcha tells Goku that he's using the drunken boxing technique, so Goku counters with his crazy monkey attack. He runs around like a monkey, and Jackie Chun can't follow him. Once this is over, Jackie Chun says that his next move will win the match.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210421.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":13,\"absoluteNumber\":26,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:32\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210431,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Number One Under The Moon\",\"aired\":\"1986-08-27\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Night begins to fall as the final match continues. Jackie Chun hypnotizes Goku and puts him to sleep. Goku can't wake up unless Jackie tells him to. Just before the count reaches 10, Bulma yells \\\"Goku! Your dinner is ready!\\\" and Goku wakes up. Then Goku uses janken attack moves, but Jackie defends them. Goku tricks him by saying \\\"paper,\\\" but throwing rock. Jackie decides to use an attack that he's only ever used once before: the Lightning Flash Surprise attack. He gathers his energy and shoots it at Goku. This energy is transformed into 20,000 volts when it hits Goku. Just as Goku is about to give up, he glimpses the moon, and transforms into a gigantic ape again. Knowing that he must stop Goku's rampage at any cost, Jackie Chun fires his most powerful Kamehameha wave. When the dust clears, it looks like Goku is dead.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210431.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":14,\"absoluteNumber\":27,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:36\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210441,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Final Blow\",\"aired\":\"1986-09-03\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Jackie Chun actually fired the wave at the moon, not Goku. Goku is found sleeping in the rubble, so they wake him up to continue the match. Krillin lends Goku his clothes. Once the match resumes, Jackie Chun tries to fire another Kamehameha wave at Goku, but finds that he doesn't have the energy. Goku kicks him out of the ring, but Jackie avoids hitting the ground by sticking his foot inside the wall. With both of them completely exhausted, they on a straightforward finish to the match. After a long bit of fighting, Goku and Jackie jump and kick each other in the face, knocking them both down. The count goes past 10, so the rules say the first person to stand up and declare victory wins. Goku struggles to his feet and nearly finishes his victory declaration, but collapses. Then Jackie Chun gets up and declares victory. After the match, Jackie secretly takes off his disguise, and they all go out to eat. Goku eats so much that Master Roshi has to spend his entire $500,000 prize on the meal.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210441.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":15,\"absoluteNumber\":28,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Tournament Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:52:40\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210081,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Roaming Lake\",\"aired\":\"1986-09-10\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Master Roshi tells Goku and Krillin to take a break from training for now, but Krillin still decides to go live with him. Goku sets off on his search for the four-star Dragon Ball. Meanwhile, Nam has arrived at his village with the water, but it is still not enough. The river has run dry, so Nam heads upstream to find the source of the disturbance. He is attacked by a dinosaur, but luckily Goku is swimming in a nearby lake and comes to rescue him. He and Nam continue upstream and find that a dam has been built. The monsters that live there refuse to tear it down. Their leader, Giran, recognizes Goku from the tournament. He says that he would tear it down, but it's too strong for them to break. Goku fires a Kamehameha wave at it, which is enough to destroy the dam. With the river replenished, everything seems okay, but a sandstorm suddenly kicks up and dries up the river again. Goku notices the lake he was swimming in before. This is the Roaming Lake, and it came to help the village.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210081.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":29,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:35\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210091,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Pilaf and The Mystery Force\",\"aired\":\"1986-09-17\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku stops at a lake for a swim. When he gets out, he finds that the dragon radar has been stolen. He picks up on the thief's scent and follows it to its source. The thief tells him that he sold the radar to an antique salesman in a nearby town. Goku locates the shop and finds his dragon radar there. He picks up a signal coming from the shop, so he turns around and sees Emperor Pilaf and Mai holding the four-star ball, having just bought it from this store. They are able to escape on their ship, but Goku follows them on the Nimbus Cloud. Back at the antique store, a mysterious military force has arrived looking for a Dragon Ball. The salesman gives them a four-star ball, but they recognize it as a fake. Pilaf's four-star ball was also a fake, but Goku doesn't yet know. The signal he picked up on was the six-star ball in a nest above the shop. A bird then flies away with the ball in its talons.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210091.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":30,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:38\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210111,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Wedding Plans\",\"aired\":\"1986-09-24\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Emperor Pilaf gives Goku the fake four-star ball, but Goku accidentally breaks it. The bird that had the six-star ball got eaten by a larger bird, and that bird got captured by the Ox King. Chi Chi thinks Goku is coming, and since she wants to marry him, the Ox King roasts the bird for a wedding feast. Emperor Pilaf's radar picks up the signal coming from Ox King's village, so Shu dresses up like Goku to get close enough to steal the ball. Goku follows his radar's signal and finds Chi Chi in a field picking flowers for the wedding. Back at the feast, suddenly the mysterious military force, the Red Ribbon Army, attacks the village, having followed the six-star ball's signal as well. Ox King tries to fight back, but gets captured. Pilaf snatches the Dragon Ball from inside the bird and takes off in his ship. Goku and Chi Chi notice smoke coming from the village, so they go to check it out.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210111.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":31,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:41\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210121,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Flying Fortress – Vanished!\",\"aired\":\"1986-10-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Chi Chi arrive at the village in time to rescue the Ox King. After a quick meal, Goku follows the signal on the dragon radar again. Emperor Pilaf's flying fortress shoots down the jets of the Red Ribbon Army and escapes. Both the Red Ribbon Army and Goku follow their signals to a remote point in the middle of the desert. Goku, searching on foot, is suddenly attacked by automatic guns rising from the sand. Colonel Silver notices this and realizes Pilaf is hiding in an underground base. Pilaf, Mai, and Shu all try to escape on the flying fortress. Goku follows them and clings to the wall of the ship. The Red Ribbon Army is waiting for them, and they destroy the fortress. Pilaf, Mai, and Shu parachute down and are forced to hand over the six-star ball.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210121.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":32,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:45\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210131,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Legend of a Dragon\",\"aired\":\"1986-10-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku calls the Nimbus Cloud to save him just before the flying fortress explodes. Then he heads off towards the nearest signal on the dragon radar. Back at Kame House, Master Roshi tells Krillin and Launch the legend of the Dragon Balls. Long ago, the seven balls were one, but evil forces tried to steal it. The ball split itself into seven useless parts, but when combined, they summon the eternal dragon who will grant one wish. Goku follows the radar to a forest where he finds the Red Ribbon Army also in search of the ball. The army is burning down the forest, so Goku tries to stop them. Suddenly, a monkey runs by holding the five-star ball. Colonel Silver shoots at it, causing the monkey to fly over the edge of a cliff. Goku grabs it, but the monkey drops the ball into a river.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210131.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":33,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:48\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210141,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Cruel General Red\",\"aired\":\"1986-10-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"While the Red Ribbon Army is searching the river for the five-star ball, Goku follows the dragon radar downstream and finds it. Before he can escape, Colonel Silver destroys the flying Nimbus. Angry, Goku easily defeats him. He finds some dyno caps in a nearby building and throws them. One is a robot, and the other is a plane. The robot flies the plane for Goku as he follows the nearest signal on the dragon radar. Goku instructs the robot to land the plane, but the robot's circuits freeze up in the extreme cold, so the plane crashes. Goku, frozen solid, is dragged away by a mysterious young girl.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210141.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":34,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:51\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210161,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Cold Reception\",\"aired\":\"1986-10-22\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The girl called Snow, takes Goku back to her house to recover. She and her mother explain that the Red Ribbon Army has taken their village chief hostage and are forcing the men to help them look for the Dragon Ball. The chief is being held in a fortress called Muscle Tower. Two soldiers break in, just as Goku is in the bathroom but Goku beats them. Snow gives Goku warm clothes to wear outside. Goku arrives at Muscle Tower and makes short work of the guards waiting outside. He uses his power pole to vault up onto the first level.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210161.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":7,\"absoluteNumber\":35,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:54\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210181,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Major Metallitron\",\"aired\":\"1986-10-29\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku enters the second floor of Muscle Tower and defeats the guards waiting for him. He heads up to the third floor where he finds a large android named Major Metallitron. Goku and Major start to fight, and after a few hits, Goku knocks him over. Goku is caught off guard when the giant gets up and grabs him. Major launches a missile at him, but he dodges it. Goku counters with a Kamehameha wave and blows Metallitron's head off. Despite being decapitated, the android is still moving. Goku punches a hole through the robot's chest, but even that doesn't stop him. The fight finally ends when Major Metallitron's batteries die.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210181.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":8,\"absoluteNumber\":36,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:54:58\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210191,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Ninja Murasaki is Coming!\",\"aired\":\"1986-11-05\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku enters the fourth floor of Muscle Tower and finds himself in the middle of a forest. Ninja Murasaki, who is hiding in the trees, has been sent to kill Goku. After games of hide and seek, racing and shuriken throwing Ninja Murasaki finally decides to fight, and Goku breaks his sword with the power pole. Murasaki throws a boomerang at him which hits and knocks out Goku.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210191.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":9,\"absoluteNumber\":37,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:01\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210201,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Five Murasakis\",\"aired\":\"1986-11-12\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku recovers from his injury and begins to chase Murasaki. The ninja then and Goku cross a pirahna infested lake. Murasaki decides to use his ultimate technique and seemingly splits into five. The five Murasakis nearly overwhelm Goku. They reveal that they are actually quindruplet brothers, not five parts of one person. Goku takes them out one by one. He chases the last Murasaki brother up to a cage. The ninja releases the monster within, Android 8.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210201.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":10,\"absoluteNumber\":38,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:04\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210221,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Mysterious Android No. 8\",\"aired\":\"1986-11-19\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Ninja Murasaki releases Android 8 to fight Goku. Android 8 however refuses to fight. Murasaki threatens Android 8 with a remote to set off a bomb inside him. Goku stops Murasaki, destroys the remote and beats the ninja. Goku has walked into a labyrinth but cannot find a way past. Android 8 comes to repay Goku with help to get past the maze. Goku nicknames Android 8 \\\"Eighter\\\". They easily stop approaching soldiers. Finally they manage to get past the trick wall at the end of the maze. They find General White waiting for them in the 6th floor command room. General White won't give up and drops Goku and Eighter down a trapdoor.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210221.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":11,\"absoluteNumber\":39,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:07\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210231,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Horrifying Buyon\",\"aired\":\"1986-11-26\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Eighter land on 5th floor. General White releases a monster to destroy the both of them. Meanwhile Snow has found some sweet furry rodents. Eighter cowers at the other side of the room while Goku fights the monster Buyon. Goku can't even hurt Buyon. Buyon eats Goku, but he struggles out. Even a Kamehameha Wave doesn't affect Buyon. Goku saves Eighter from being eaten. Recalling an earlier exchange with Snow, Goku punches a hole in the wall letting in cold air and freezing Buyon solid. Goku smashes Buyon and ascends with Eighter back to the command room.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210231.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":12,\"absoluteNumber\":40,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:09\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210241,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Fall of Muscle Tower\",\"aired\":\"1986-12-03\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku fights General White who is not very fit. Eighter is too pacifistic to join in the fight as General White grabs Goku by the tail. After giving General White a severe bashing, the latter pretends to surrender and releases the village chief. When the chief's back is turned, General White threatens Goku and Eighter to shoot the chief. The chief is hesistant whether he wants to live or die. Then the General blackmails Eighter into beating Goku. Hearing this, an enraged Goku demands that White deal with him, and White promptly shoots Goku. Eighter loses his temper and punches General White out of the tower. Finally all three leave the tower and Eighter destroys it. They all receive a warm welcome back at Snow's house.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210241.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":13,\"absoluteNumber\":41,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:12\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210261,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Secret of Dr. Flappe\",\"aired\":\"1986-12-10\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The village is safe again but Snow's parents wonder where the dragonball was. Eighter had it all along so General White wouldn't exterminate the village. Unfortunately Eighter cannot risk staying in the village with the bomb still inside him. The chief suggests they go to Dr. Flappe to sort the problem. Goku has broken his dragon radar. While Snow, Goku and Eighter head to Dr. Flappe, Murasaki (who has survived) stalks them. Before Dr. Flappe can get to work, Murasaki surprises him. It is revealed Dr. Flappe created Eighter, not the RR Army. Murasaki forces Dr. Flappe to swipe Goku's dragonballs. Goku chases and beats the ninja. Dr. Flappe is able to take the bomb out of Eighter but cannot fix Goku's radar. Goku throws the bomb which kills Murasaki.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210261.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":14,\"absoluteNumber\":42,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:15\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210271,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"A Trip to the City\",\"aired\":\"1986-12-17\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"After spending a night in Snow's house one of the villagers helps Goku summon his Nimbus next morning. Goku reaches West City, but has no idea where to find Bulma. Nobody he meets has a clue. Goku hasn't got any money, but manages to win a lot in a street fighting competition. Along the way, Goku is abducted by a couple of thieving rogues, but they are far from a problem for him. Goku finds a policeman to direct him to Bulma's house which is the Capsule Corp where dyno caps were first invented.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210271.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":15,\"absoluteNumber\":43,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:19\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210281,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Master Thief, Haski\",\"aired\":\"1986-12-24\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Bulma is currently out. Bulma shortly returns skipping school hours. Bulma leads Goku and the policeman to the garden where Bulma's Dad is. While Bulma fixes the radar, her dad fixes the policeman's motorcycle. Bulma finds Goku has procured 2 dragonballs. To come with Goku, Bulma demonstrates her Microband invention. Meanwhile the RR Army are plotting against Goku. General Black has hired a master thief to get the balls from him, Haski. The thieving rogues team up with her. Goku and Bulma meet up with Yamcha, Puar and Oolong. They all decide to go to the new Dreamland amusement park. Haski is ready to make her move.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210281.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":16,\"absoluteNumber\":44,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:22\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1986\"},{\"id\":1210291,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Danger in the Air\",\"aired\":\"1987-01-07\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's group enters the Dreamland amusement park, Haski and her two men stalking them. Haski plans how to steal the dragonballs while Goku's group is having fun. Haski baits the group into thinking she is a poor but promising fortuneteller. Goku makes it difficult for Haski but with the Dragonballs in Yamcha's possession, Haski seizes her chance. Haski's cover is shortly blown but she swipes the Dragonballs. Haski says she's planted a bomb to blow up Dreamland. Yamcha manages to tell Goku. On his Flying Nimbus Goku chases Haski's hover ship. Goku pins down Haski, disarms the bomb and takes back the Dragonballs. Bulma dumps Yamcha and she and Goku head off to search for the remaining dragonballs.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210291.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":17,\"absoluteNumber\":45,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:25\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209941,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Bulma's Bad Day\",\"aired\":\"1987-01-14\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Bulma head to an island to look for a dragonball. The island however is under the control of General Blue of the RR Army. Goku lands on the island and Bulma finds only one dyno cap in her dad's case, but all there is are several nudie mags. Bulma snatches the lot and gets frustrated and furious that her dad is into this and shreds them up. Goku dives into the ocean but cannot dive deep enough to find the dragonball. Meanwhile a couple of RR pilots are shooting at Bulma. As the pilots harass Bulma, Goku comes and blows them from the sky. Goku decides to go to Master Roshi's much to Bulma's dismay.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209941.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":18,\"absoluteNumber\":46,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:28\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209951,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Kame House - Found!\",\"aired\":\"1987-01-21\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As General Blue's men recover the scouts, Goku makes it to Roshi's island. Roshi offers the submarine (which Krillin and Launch are using) in exchange for Bulma's microband. Meanwhile Commander Red orders General Blue to take action. Roshi attempts to use the microband for some indecent mischief and Launch and Krillin return. While planning to find the dragonball Krillin mentions something about Pirates' Treasure and Master Roshi tells the tale of it. After Goku, Bulma and Krillin leave, a RR scout spies the island.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209951.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":19,\"absoluteNumber\":47,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:31\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209961,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Deep Blue Sea\",\"aired\":\"1987-01-28\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Krillin manages to manuever the air/sub ship to the location where the dragonball is. General Blue plans to tail Goku, while another squad heads to Roshi's Island. Despite their searching, Bulma, Krillin and Goku don't find the dragonball on the ocean bed. Meanwhile General Blue prepares and launches all his forces. As Krillin drives the sub into a cave, General Blue's submarines tail and attack them. Krillin makes it to narrower caves, but General Blue sends his minisubs to pursue them.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209961.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":20,\"absoluteNumber\":48,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:34\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209971,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Roshi Surprise\",\"aired\":\"1987-02-04\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"General Blue continues to chase Bulma, Goku and Krillin in their submarine. He resorts to ramming them into the cave walls. Meanwhile Master Roshi is having a bit of trouble with aggressive Launch. As Launch turns back into her gentle self, Captain Dock's flying circus approaches and lands on the island. Roshi mocks the Captain and does a surprise attack on the men, aggressive Launch finishing it off. Goku, Bulma and Krillin narrowly escape Blue's subs and surface into a long dark tunnel. Goku finds a button and lights up the tunnel. At the sight of a skeleton, Krillin confirms the place is the Pirates' hideout. Hearing that the legend is true, General Blue has new ideas.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209971.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":21,\"absoluteNumber\":49,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:38\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209981,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Trap is Sprung\",\"aired\":\"1987-02-11\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"General Blue continues to follow Goku, Krillin and Bulma whilst Commander Red is impatient for results. The trio walk into a spear trap room. Goku and Krillin jump over the floor buttons but Goku has to manuever Bulma with his power pole. Blue's soldiers get killed by the trap but General Blue finds a secret passage. As the trio cross a dark passage, they fall down an unstable floor into a lava pit, but Goku vaults them out with his power pole. General Blue gets attacked by an electric eel but manages to kill it. As the trio linger in the Pirates' port, a deadly robot emerges bent on terminating intruders.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209981.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":22,\"absoluteNumber\":50,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:41\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209991,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Beware of Robot\",\"aired\":\"1987-02-18\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Krillin fight the Pirate robot in between evading its heavy machine gun and sword. Krillin manages to disarm the sword from it. General Blue stays in hiding watching the fight. Bulma fires a gun cannon on the robot as it skis across a pool. As Goku fights the robot with his power pole, Bulma rams a truck on it. Next the robot drags Goku into an underwater battle, Goku narrowly escaping. The robot chases Bulma and Krillin through the hideout where all the pirates are dead. Goku recovers and rescues the other two. Goku performs an aerial attack smashing the robot. As everyone makes their way through the inner halls, the place begins to collapse. Goku takes a different route from the others. Bulma, Krillin and General Blue are forced to dive into a well.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209991.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":23,\"absoluteNumber\":51,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:44\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1210001,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Pirate Treasure\",\"aired\":\"1987-02-25\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As the hideout continues to collapse, Goku reaches a dead end and falls down a trapdoor onto a giant octopus. Krillin and Bulma emerge into a room with a booby trapped ten-armed statue and three chests and General Blue emerges. Krillin disarms the statue and opens the gold chest while Goku blasts and eats the octopus. Krillin inserts a key in the statue and General Blue shows himself to the two. General Blue mocks Krillin as he fights him. Goku hears the fight and swims to them. General Blue demonstrates he's very sensitive about his good looks and stuns Krillin making it easy to beat him. General Blue isn't affected by Bulma's charms. Goku arrives just before General Blue can kill Krillin.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210001.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":24,\"absoluteNumber\":52,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:47\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1210011,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Blue, Black and Blue\",\"aired\":\"1987-03-04\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Blue start fighting and Goku is winning till Blue powers up. Meanwhile the whole ceiling is collapsing. He is just about to kill Goku when a mouse scares him.Goku gets up and beats Blue. Bulma and Krillin want to get out before the ceiling falls but Goku wants to find the dragon ball. Once he gets it, he picks the mouse that saved him and runs, but Bulma and Krillin are about to leave.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210011.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":25,\"absoluteNumber\":53,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:51\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1210021,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Escape From Pirate Cave\",\"aired\":\"1987-03-11\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku makes it to the getaway submarine in the nick of time still carrying the mouse in his mouth. As the trio escape, rocks collapse and hit the sub and it soon runs out of fuel. Goku manages to launch the sub to the surface with a Kamehameha Wave. Bulma has managed to take one diamond with her. General Blue also reaches the surface. In the Blue Sector HQ Goku fiddles with the radio. As the trio make their way to Master Roshi's, General Blue follows. As Roshi gets the diamond, he is forced to hand it to aggressive Launch who makes off with it. General Blue lands on the island preparing for revenge.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210021.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":26,\"absoluteNumber\":54,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:54\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1210031,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Penguin Village\",\"aired\":\"1987-03-18\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"General Blue binds the occupants of the Kame house with rope he powered with pyschic waves. General Blue then steals the dragon balls and sets a 5 minute bomb. Gentle Launch makes it in time to release Goku and Goku throws out the bomb. Goku then chases General Blue. As Goku and General Blue speed up to max, they both fly across a strange island. A speedy girl with a couple of sprites watch in awe. General Blue causes Goku to fall but crashes his jet into a mountain.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210031.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":27,\"absoluteNumber\":55,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:55:57\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1210041,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Strange Visitor\",\"aired\":\"1987-03-25\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The girl introduces herself as Arale and the sprites are Gachem 1 \\u0026 2. Blue flees before Goku can find him. Arale and Gachem 1 \\u0026 2 catch up with Goku and are able to ride on the Nimbus with him. Blue meets Showerman and commandeers his car. Goku meets a lady called Akuma and a policeman called Toro both incapable of riding the Nimbus. The mention of the RR Army terrifies Toro. Blue meets someone who resembles his little brother and attacks Toro and his partners. As Goku tries to find the General, Arale bumps into Blue and she and Gachem 1 \\u0026 2 try to socialise with him, to Blue's horror. Goku fails to find Blue and can't get the dragon radar to work. Arale takes Goku to a doctor to get it fixed.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210041.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":28,\"absoluteNumber\":56,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:00\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1210051,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Arale vs. Blue\",\"aired\":\"1987-04-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Senbei attempts to fix the dragon radar while Officer Toro stumbles in the coffee shop. Baby Turbo manages to help Senbei fix the radar. Blue arrives and waits for his chance to steal the plane by the family's house. Blue tries to avoid detection from Goku's fixed radar. The police at the station are getting trigger happy. Goku finds Blue by surprise and Blue threatens Arale with a knife in front of the family. Blue stuns Goku and swipes his radar. Before Blue can kill Goku, Arale jumps in and chases him through Penguin village. Meanwhile a small fight occurs between the police and a couple of aliens, mistakenly taken for the Red Ribbon Army. Turbo offers to make a new radar for the one Goku lost. Blue is shown making contact with Red from a desolated area.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1210051.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":29,\"absoluteNumber\":57,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:04\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209791,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Land of Korin\",\"aired\":\"1987-04-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"In the Land of Korin, Captain Yellow is looking for another dragonball. They find the ball in the crater of a volcano. Near a massive tower that reaches the sky Bora and his son Upa are fishing. As Captain Yellow's men retrieve the dragonball, the volcano erupts. Bora gets hold of the dragonball. As Yellow and his men land, Bora demands they leave. When they see him carrying the dragonball they attack him but Bora resists. Bora kills a grenadier who comes from behind him and beats down Yellow's men. Yellow kidnaps Upa to blackmail Bora. Goku arrives in time to defeat Yellow and save Upa (who is able to ride the Nimbus). The dragonball Bora has is the very one Goku was looking for. Meanwhile the guards of the RR base hardly recognize General Blue on his arrival. Commander Red has summoned the infamous Mercenary Tao.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209791.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":30,\"absoluteNumber\":58,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:07\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209801,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Notorious Mercenary\",\"aired\":\"1987-04-22\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"General Blue enters the RR base and Commander Red is making a pretty expensive deal Mercenary Tao. Despite procuring the dragon radar, Red is displeased with Blue and offers him the a second chance if he can defeat Mercenary Tao. Meanwhile Bora tells Goku the legend of the Korin Tower. General Blue thinks Mercenary Tao is a joke. Tao is very quick in both dodging and attacking, and even proves to be immune to Blue's paralysis technique. Using only the tip of his tongue, Tao kills Blue. After being briefed of his target, Tao travels on a flying pillar to Korin's Land. As Goku, Bora and Upa are enjoying themselves, Tao storms in and Bora fights him. Bora is killed by Tao, leaving Upa in grief and Goku in anger.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209801.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":31,\"absoluteNumber\":59,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:10\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209811,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tao Attacks!\",\"aired\":\"1987-04-29\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku fights Tao. Despite his best attacks, Goku takes a severe beating from Tao. A Kamehameha Wave has no effect on Tao, but it sears his outfit. Angered, Tao fires a lethal beam (Dodon Wave) from his finger on Goku. Tao takes the dragonballs and taunts Upa before making his leave. Tao heads to a town to get a new outfit,while Red tells him that he is one dragonball short. Upa has buried his father and is about to bury Goku when an RR pilot lands. As the pilot tries to take the dragonball Goku kept, Goku beats him and blasts his jet. Apparently Goku's grandfather's dragonball blocked the Dodon Wave. Not knowing what to do next, Upa suggests that Goku tries to climb the Korin Tower. Goku makes a good start, while Tao waits for his outfit to be tailored to Red's frustration. The tower is indeed a lot higher than Goku thought and he nearly falls off but continues his long journey without giving up.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209811.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":32,\"absoluteNumber\":60,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:13\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209821,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Korin Tower\",\"aired\":\"1987-05-06\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku reaches the summit of Korin's tower. He sees visions of the past, present and future. Goku goes upstairs to meet Korin (who is nothing more than a blind cat). Korin is not about to hand the sacred water to Goku. An assassin fails to kill Mercenary Tao as he heads to his usual luxurious hotel to take a boiling hot bath. Korin seems to be deceitful not letting Goku take the bottle of sacred water. After a long hard attempt trying to get the sacred water, Korin reveals that Master Roshi was the first to climb the tower and it took him three years to get the water.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209821.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":33,\"absoluteNumber\":61,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:17\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209831,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Sacred Water\",\"aired\":\"1987-05-13\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku attempts to snatch the sacred water from Korin with his After Image technique which is no surprise to Korin. The next day Korin gives Goku a Sensu Bean to last Goku's apetite and energy for ten days. Korin throws Goku's dragonball out of the tower forcing Goku to run down and up the tower again. Goku attempts to take the sacred water in Korin's sleep, but thinks better of it. Goku tries long and hard for the next two days to get the sacred water. Mercenary Tao realises how he wasn't able to kill Goku. Goku attempts to read Korin by mimicking his every move. The very next day, Goku finally manages to get the sacred water. To his disappointment it doesn't strengthen him, but all that exercise did him good. Tao kills the tailor who made his outfit before leaving. Goku also makes his leave.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209831.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":34,\"absoluteNumber\":62,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:20\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209841,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Return of Goku\",\"aired\":\"1987-05-20\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Tao arrives and bullies Upa. Goku arrives to save him and rounds on Tao. After a small talk, Goku demonstrates his speed and strength on Tao. Tao also happens to know the legend of Korin's tower and the sacred water. Goku blocks most attacks from Tao to Upa's surprise. Meanwhile Bulma is working on a new scout plane to assist Goku. Goku beats Tao a lot. Tao's Dodon Wave only singes Goku's hands. Tao resorts to wielding a sword on Goku, but Upa fetches Goku his power pole and Goku breaks Tao's sword. Tao kicks a stone, missing Upa and destroying the teepee. Tao decides to climb the tower to get the sacred water.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209841.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":35,\"absoluteNumber\":63,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:23\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209851,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Last of Mercenary Tao\",\"aired\":\"1987-05-27\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"While Mercenary Tao tires himself climbing the tower, Goku enjoys his moments with Upa who is amazed at Goku's confidence. Meanwhile Bulma's dragon radar is malfunctioning due to some radar jamming situation which is also affecting Commander Red. Tao reaches the tower summit and meets Korin. Arrogant Tao drinks the sacred water and Korin tricks him into thinking his strength is boosted. In addition Korin gives Tao a dark cloud to ride. Korin then causes Tao to plummet to the ground. Tao beats Goku, but Goku was just taking blows to read his moves. Tao acts a surrender and throws a napalm grenade at Goku, but Goku kicks it back. The bomb explodes right in Tao's front killing him. Meanwhile Bulma has finishing engineering her radar against the radar jammer which also boosts Goku's. Goku is off to defeat the RR at their HQ.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209851.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":36,\"absoluteNumber\":64,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:26\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209861,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Confront the Red Ribbon Army\",\"aired\":\"1987-06-10\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Commander Red receives word that Colonel Violet has tracked another dragonball. Her divers successfully procure the ball. As they are attacked by a giant alligator and savages, Violet selfishly leaves her men to die, giving her the chance to escape with the ball. Violet hands the ball to Commander Red receiving a pint-sized reward. Bulma has completed her spy camera to find Goku and launches it. As Goku makes his way to the RR HQ, Commander Red is convinced it is Mercenary Tao. Bulma's spy camera is destroyed when it hovers above the RR base. Bulma, Launch and Roshi realise Goku is making a direct attack on the RR base. Yamcha, Oolong and Puar receive the news and off to take the others to follow Goku.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209861.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":37,\"absoluteNumber\":65,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:30\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209871,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"A Real Bind\",\"aired\":\"1987-06-17\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"While Yamcha and the others are flying after Goku, they decide to find Krillin. They find Krillin swimming but he flees before he realises they're here to pick him up. Goku beats a scout of the sky and his cover is blown. Goku gets past the defenses and penetrates the base perimeter. All at once he has the entire army on top of him. Yamcha flies the plane into the RR sector barely escaping a heat seeker missile. Colonel Violet is grabbing every scrap of money she can get. Goku infiltrates Red's command building as Commander Red retreats to his office with General Black.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209871.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":38,\"absoluteNumber\":66,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:33\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209881,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The End of Commander Red\",\"aired\":\"1987-06-24\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The warfare against Goku continues for the RR Army. Then the soldiers flee in terror except for Colonel Violet who is heading for Red's treasure vault. Violet swipes all the money and valuables and makes her leave. Red gets frustrated and angry and leaves Black to face Goku as he retreats to his penthouse. As Goku beats Black, Red activates the ceiling to crush Goku. Having been betrayed and risking his life, Black kills Red. Goku emerges from the wreckage and Black tries to talk his way out, but Goku won't fall for his lies. As a last resort Black uses a mech robot machine to take out Goku. Meanwhile Yamcha and Violet are both trying to evade each other. General Black beats Goku plenty and is preparing to fire a lethal weapon on him.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209881.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":39,\"absoluteNumber\":67,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:36\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1269841,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Last Dragon Ball\",\"aired\":\"1987-07-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As Yamcha nears the RR base, Goku evades Black's laser cannon. Annoyed at Goku's survival, Black uses all he's got against him and Goku destroys the robot mech suit along with Black. Goku now has six dragonballs but cannot track the last one. By the time Yamcha and the others arrive, the war is over and Goku reunites with the lot. Goku's success crippling the RR Army amazes everyone. Puar scouts around but finds no one and Launch turns back into sweet Launch. Even Goku's climbing to the peak of Korin's Tower surprises Roshi. Bulma promises to fix the dragon radar and Goku promises to have Bora resurrected.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1269841.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":40,\"absoluteNumber\":68,\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Red Ribbon Army Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:56:40\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209631,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Who is Fortuneteller Baba?\",\"aired\":\"1987-07-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Bulma finds there is nothing wrong with the dragon radar and thinks something organic must have swallowed the ball that puts the ball off detection. Roshi suggests Goku visits Fortuneteller Baba to find the last dragonball with her clairvoyance. Goku takes off with Yamcha, Puar and Krillin. They stop at a town and Goku needs to get a new suit of clothes. While a new martial suit is being made, Goku flies take Upa on the adventure with him. After changing into his new clothes, Goku and his friends head off to Fortuneteller Baba's palace passing desert tornados and storms. Goku is greeted by Ghost at the palace. A group of mean-looking visitors enter the palace and leave in a devastated state. Goku and the others enter and meet Fortuneteller Baba who isn't what they expected. Baba is asking a huge price for a single fortune and Goku's only alternative is to battle five warriors of Baba's.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209631.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":69,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:19\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209641,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"We Are The Five Warriors\",\"aired\":\"1987-07-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Yamcha, Krillin and Goku feel up to fighting while Upa and Puar choose to stay back. Krillin starts against Fangs the Vampire. Krillin misses every time and is beaten when Fangs sinks his fangs into Krillin's scalp. Krillin loses a lot of blood and Fangs pushes him into the lake. Ghost attends to Krillin's blood loss. Unsuspecting Upa and Puar volunteer to be the next to fight Fangs together, which Fangs agrees to. Scared but determined, Upa breathes crunched up garlic in Fangs' face. Fangs then rounds on Puar but she turns into porcupine that impales Fangs' jaws. She then turns into a giant hand and slaps Fangs into the lake. Yamcha chooses to fight next. Baba tells Yamcha he is fighting an invisible warrior. While Yamcha's attempts are unsuccessful, Krillin sends Goku to fetch Bulma and Roshi. Yamcha tries hearing the invisible man out.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209641.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":70,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:22\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209651,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Deadly Battle\",\"aired\":\"1987-07-22\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku locates Roshi and Bulma in their capsule ship. Goku collects Roshi and Bulma in a careless manner than makes the ship swurve down and aggressive Launch takes control in the nick of time. Yamcha's hearing the invisible man works out at first until Baba starts singing awfully. Yamcha takes repetitive blows. Krillin diverts the invisible man with applause giving Yamcha the chance to fight back, but the invisible man becomes silent and starts devastating Yamcha. Goku arrives with Roshi and Bulma. With a thrust of Bulma's breast, Krillin makes Roshi have a violent nosebleed right on the invisible man, exposing him to Yamcha. Yamcha beats the invisible man with a Wolf Fang Fist, forcing him to surrender. Roshi reveals that Baba is his sister. For the next fight Baba leads the whole lot into her creepy tower. Yamcha is to fight in a realm called 'The Devil's Toilet'. Baba takes Goku to her home room, serving him a meal while testing his reflexes. Baba has creepy ideas in store for Goku and his friends.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209651.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":71,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:25\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209661,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Turn\",\"aired\":\"1987-07-29\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Baba summons a coffin. Out comes Yamcha's opponent, a mummified warrior. The mummy is a lot faster and stronger than he looks and Yamcha nearly falls in the Devil's Toilet. The mummy beats Yamcha despite his attempt to retaliate a surprise attack. Puar cuts in, but it makes matters worse. Goku saves Yamcha and enters the next fight.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209661.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":72,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:28\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209671,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Devilmite Beam\",\"aired\":\"1987-08-05\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The mummy feels a bit hesitant to fight Goku. Goku whets the mummy's apetite and counterstrikes. The mummy binds Goku with his own bandages. After a long struggle, Goku jumps down just beyond the deadly toilet water and breaks free. Goku defeats the mummy with a single punch. Goku's next opponent is a demon called Spike. The demon seems easy to beat and he nearly falls in the toilet. Spike prepares to use his Devilmite beam to finish Goku.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209671.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":73,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:31\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209681,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Mysterious Fifth Man\",\"aired\":\"1987-08-12\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Master Roshi briefs the others on the story of the Spike. Spike fires his Devilmite beam on Goku. Goku resists the beam entirely. Spike fires a stronger Devilmite beam. Goku resists that one entirely as well. Spike then flails a trident at Goku. A mysterious man wearing a cat mask and a halo on his head has been watching Goku closely. Goku almost falls in the Devil's Toilet but climbs on the other side of the bridge and surprises Spike. Goku finishes Spike with a mighty kick. The final fighter requests Baba that he and Goku fight outside. Roshi senses some familiarity of the fifth fighter. The fight begins.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209681.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":74,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:35\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209691,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Strong Ones\",\"aired\":\"1987-08-19\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The final fight begins with a struggle. Both opponents are evenly matched. The masked man launches Goku in the air and sends him crashing through the stage, but Goku attacks back. The masked man launches a Kamehameha Wave, which Goku avoids. Goku does his own Kamehameha Wave on the masked man. The masked man grabs Goku's tail, disabling him from fighting. The masked man is getting more familiar to Roshi all the time and he has a good idea who is under the mask. Roshi reveals that the man is none other than Goku's deceased grandfather Gohan.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209691.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":7,\"absoluteNumber\":75,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:38\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209701,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The True Colors of the Masked Man\",\"aired\":\"1987-08-26\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Gohan repeatedly slams Goku against the floor. Meanwhile Pilaf is trying out his new power suit and Shu and Mai spy from a satelite on Goku. It turns out Pilaf has the final dragonball and has jammed the dragon radar. Eventually Goku's tail rips off. Gohan surrenders and reveals his face to Goku. Bulma retells her adventures with Goku. Gohan chooses to stay dead and vanishes after a farewell. Baba reveals the exact location of the last dragon ball.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209701.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":8,\"absoluteNumber\":76,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:42\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209711,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Pilaf's Tactics\",\"aired\":\"1987-09-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku flies his Nimbus after Pilaf's car to get the last dragon ball. Pilaf is heading to Baba's place in hope of procuring the other dragon balls, thinking Goku still has a weakness. Goku stops the car and recognises his previous enemies. Pilaf challenges Goku to a battle, with his Dragon ball against all 6 in Goku's possession. Pilaf, Shu and Mai get in their powersuits. The machines are unaffected by Goku's first attacks. The machines corner Goku and Shu burns his clothes off. To Pilaf's horror he finds Goku has no tail. Pilaf, Mai and Shu combine their powersuits into a titanic machine. Using a Kamehameha Wave, Goku blasts the side of Mai's powersuit. Mai ditches her broken powersuit and rides Pilaf's and Shu's combined powersuits as the trio flees. Shu fires a missile, but Goku throws it right back, trashing the powersuits. Pilaf gives Goku the dragonball and Shu gives him his clothes.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209711.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":9,\"absoluteNumber\":77,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:45\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209721,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Eternal Dragon Rises\",\"aired\":\"1987-09-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku flies back to Baba's place and takes Upa with all the dragonballs to the Land of Korin. Yamcha wants to train with Roshi who doesn't feel up to it but Bulma changes his mind. Goku and Upa have fun on their journey. Goku summons the eternal dragon and with a pluck of his courage, Upa wishes his father be resurrected. The dragon grants the wish and Bora rises from his grave. Upa delightfully embraces his father and the dragon vanishes into the seven balls. Before they can scatter Goku grabs the four star ball already turning to stone. Goku bids Bora and Upa farewell and heads back to Baba's place. Roshi says that he has nothing more to teach Goku. Goku walks without any use of the Nimbus cloud ready for training and adventure.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209721.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":10,\"absoluteNumber\":78,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:49\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209731,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Terror and Plague\",\"aired\":\"1987-09-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku is travelling when he sees a girl about to be eaten by a tiger-monster.He saves her and she asks him to help her village which is being terrorized by 2 people called Terror and Plague. When they reach the village they see that there is a call going on in which when a person's name is called, and he doesn't reply 'here' he'll be sent inside the gourd(a thing Terror and Plague use to trap people).Goku shows up and challenges them and beats them but they use the gourd and trap him.Goku escapes the gourd with his power pole and takes the gourd, trapping Terror and Plague.They feel sorry and Goku releases them and they now work for the villagers.Goku then travels on towards the wilderness.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209731.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":11,\"absoluteNumber\":79,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:52\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209741,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku vs. Sky Dragon\",\"aired\":\"1987-09-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku makes an enduring journey to challenge Master Chin. Chin is busy fending off Rising Dragon and his two men. Before Rising Dragon can begin a fight, his brother Sky Dragon stops him. Chin's agrees to workout with Goku, his son Shoken getting worried. Goku finds Chin has been in weak health lately and learns from him about the King's Tournament. Goku manages to get medicine for Chin, managing to avoid conflict with the Dragon brothers. Sky Dragon spends his time terrifying his students. Goku volunteers to take Chin's place in the King's Tournament. Jealous Shoken spikes Goku's breakfast. At the tournament Goku battles Sky Dragon as the laxative kicks in Goku, but he resists the effect and beats Sky Dragon. The Dragon brothers and students join Chin's teachings and Goku resumes his journey.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209741.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":12,\"absoluteNumber\":80,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:55\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209751,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku Goes to Demon Land\",\"aired\":\"1987-09-30\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"In a castle Princess Misa is taken by a demon. Goku reaches the village avoiding the traps. In the castle the king has doubts Goku will succeed but recruits him to face the demon Shula after seeing his fighting skills. At that moment the demons are rampaging the village. The king escorts Goku to the portal next day and Goku cannot pull Shula's sword from the door. At the Kame House, Launch is getting agitated with Roshi and Yamcha and Krillin are hard at training. Goku meets the guards Gola and Maylay, who advise caution fighting Shula, who intends to marry Princess Misa. Goku defeats the first demon and shocks everyone with his intention to fight Shula. Goku beats Shula and escapes with Misa, Maylay and Gola helping. Goku pulls out Shula's sword and seals the portal.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209751.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":13,\"absoluteNumber\":81,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:57:58\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209761,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Rampage Of InoShikaCho\",\"aired\":\"1987-10-07\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku finds some people running away from their village. They say that a monster named InoShikaCho is terrorizing their village. Goku goes to the village and finds two men, one of whom has a third eye, who defeated Inoshikacho. The villagers pay them 100,000 seni for their services. Later, Goku finds them in the woods with InoShikaCho around a campfire. Goku realizes that they only pretend to kill the monster to get money. The three-eyed stranger fights Goku. He chops down a tree, which falls on Goku. A girl wakes him up, saying that she found him unconscious in the woods. Goku goes to the next village and finds The two strangers pulling the same trick. Goku says that they're friends with InoShikaCho, but they trick the villagers into believing Goku is friends with them. Goku picks up InoShikaCho and runs off, but the villagers catch him. The girl who saved him appears and clears Goku's name.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209761.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":14,\"absoluteNumber\":82,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:01\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":1209771,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Which Way to Papaya Island?\",\"aired\":\"1987-10-14\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Three years have passed, and it is the day before the World Martial Arts Tournament. Goku sees three guys beating someone up, so he steps in and fights. They run away, and the guy he saved, Konkichi, is very thankful. Konkichi takes Goku to the airport so he can fly to Papaya Island, the site of the tournament. Goku has no money, so they go to a carnival to win some. Goku wins enough money for the tickets, so they head back to the airport. Goku sees Fortuneteller Baba, so he stops to talk. Konkichi runs off, but is caught by the same guys as before. They force him to rob a bank, but he gets caught. Konkichi admits to Goku that he was a criminal, but he wants to change. Baba tells Goku where the three men are, so he takes off after them. He catches them and brings them to jail. Unfortunately, he missed his flight, so he decides to swim to Papaya Island.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/1209771.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":15,\"absoluteNumber\":83,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:04\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206762,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Rivals and Arrivals\",\"aired\":\"1987-10-21\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As Master Roshi and the rest of the gang head for the World Martial Arts Tournament, one member is noticeably absent: Goku! After three years of training, his mysterious disappearance is baffling, but if he doesn't reach the sign-in booth on time, he won't get to compete!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206762.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":16,\"absoluteNumber\":84,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:08\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206763,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Preliminary Peril\",\"aired\":\"1987-10-28\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Three years of intense training has led Goku and his friends to this day. The World Martial Arts Tournament begins! Among the competitors is a dangerous foe who nearly destroyed Goku in their first encounter. Get ready for action!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206763.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":17,\"absoluteNumber\":85,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:11\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206764,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Then There Were Eight\",\"aired\":\"1987-11-04\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"In his first match of the preliminaries, Goku coincidentially gets one of the most dangerous opponents in the world, King Chappa. He is said to be the single greatest warrior of his time, once winning the World Martial Arts Tournament without his opponents laying a single hand on him! Goku has an uncanny smirk, not affected by the rumors.\\r\\nReady! Set! Go! Goku gets in the first punch and has King Chappa eating his words. It seems Goku is no ordinary child. Things heat up and the two show no mercy. Finally, one of Goku's combos get through and knock the legendary King Chappa down. But judging from his angry roar, he isn't happy!!! King Chappa is about to use his pantented eight-handed technique. Nicknamed, for it is so quick-his onslaught appears to be comprised of eight hands! But Goku dodges and counters every one of those eight hands quicker than he can throw them. He smirks once more and trips him with his tail. Goku takes to the air and King Chappa prepares to attack. Master Roshi s\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206764.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":18,\"absoluteNumber\":86,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:13\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206765,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Yamcha vs. Tien\",\"aired\":\"1987-11-11\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The excitement grows as everyone eggs on the Grand Finals. Goku remains calm while others are more nervous. Tien shows up and insults Yamcha as usual. Then, Chiaotzu comes along and Krillin gives him a piece of his mind. \\\"\\\"Are you going to say something or what?\\\"\\\"(Honestly, I understand. Chaiotzu never says a word!)\\\"\\\"Baldy!\\\"\\\" replies Chiaotzu. WHAAAAAAT?!, the insulted Krillin yells. \\\"\\\"It's not exactly like you have a lion's maine under there, cueball!\\\"\\\"(If anyone watched this ep. closely enough I may have words slighty off. So, if you can, send me the exact quotes in the viewer's comments. thanks)Not exactly, says Chiaotzu. He removes his hat only to reveal.......there's only ONE SQUIGGLY HAIR under there!!! Tien shelters Chiaotzu as if he were his older brother telling him to put his hat back on before he catches a cold. Like Tien actually has a sensitive side to him!\\r\\nOutside, Oolong and Puar go off in search of Master Roshi. Puar checks the crowd and Oolong checks all the bathrooms. Oolon\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206765.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":19,\"absoluteNumber\":87,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:17\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206766,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Yamcha's Big Break\",\"aired\":\"1987-11-18\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As the World Martial Arts Tournament continues, the first match in the Quarter-Finals is well underway, with Yamcha challenging Tien Shinhan. With these two warriors locked in combat, one thing is certain: sparks will fly!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206766.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":20,\"absoluteNumber\":88,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:19\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206767,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Full-Moon Vengeance\",\"aired\":\"1987-11-25\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The second match has begun, with Jackie Chun versus Man Wolf. While Jackie Chun wants to advance to the semi finals, Man Wolf is more interested in something else. He reveals Jackie is to blame for his current state and he has been training for three years to exact his revenge. Can Jackie come out of this fight in one piece and be of some help to Man Wolf at the same time?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206767.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":21,\"absoluteNumber\":89,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:22\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206768,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Dodon Wave!\",\"aired\":\"1987-12-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The next match is underway, with Krillin and Chiaotzu proving to be evenly matched. But when Chiaotzu unleashes a new technique, the Dodan Wave, it could spell trouble for Krillin.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206768.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":22,\"absoluteNumber\":90,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:25\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206769,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Counting Controversy!\",\"aired\":\"1987-12-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The match continues, in which Chiaotzu launches something even worse than the Dodon Wave against Krillin. Krillin's only chance to catch Chiaotzu off guard is the most unexpected technique in martial arts: math. But long after the match is over, Goku and Krillin learn there is more at stake than the championship as Master Shen wants revenge for Goku defeating Tao.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206769.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":23,\"absoluteNumber\":91,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:29\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206770,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku Enters The Ring\",\"aired\":\"1987-12-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku finally gets to step into the ring and begin his match, where he finds a world-renowned fighter and action star waiting for him. This star has come to the tournament to claim the only title he's never won, Master of Martial Arts, making this determined fight to the end.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206770.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":24,\"absoluteNumber\":92,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:31\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206771,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tien Shinhan vs. Jackie Chun\",\"aired\":\"1987-12-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The Tournament semi-finals have begun, pitting Tien against Jackie Chun. It's a battle between the young and the old as both warriors combat with amazing skill.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206771.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":25,\"absoluteNumber\":93,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:35\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206772,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Stepping Down\",\"aired\":\"1987-12-30\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The match between Jackie Chun and Tien heats up as both fighters pull out every trick they know. But what will happen when even the audience gets caught in the middle of this?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206772.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":26,\"absoluteNumber\":94,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:38\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1987\"},{\"id\":206773,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku vs. Krillin\",\"aired\":\"1988-01-06\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"goku fights Krillin.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206773.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":27,\"absoluteNumber\":95,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:41\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206774,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tail's Tale\",\"aired\":\"1988-01-13\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The fight between Goku and Krillin heats up as the World Martial Arts Tournament continues. What began as friendly combat turns to all-out war after Krillin pulls a sneaky stunt behind Goku's back. Tempers flare, the battle turns fierce, and a once strong friendship all but disappears. Be prepared! The outcome of this match will knock you off your feet!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206774.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":28,\"absoluteNumber\":96,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:44\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206775,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Final Match: Goku vs. Tien Shinhan\",\"aired\":\"1988-01-20\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The final match in the 22nd World Martial Arts Tournament is about to begin! Goku faces Tien Shinhan in a climactic battle to see who will become the next Master of Martial Arts! However, if Tien has his way, this will be Goku's final match, period!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206775.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":29,\"absoluteNumber\":97,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:48\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206776,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Victory's Edge\",\"aired\":\"1988-01-27\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Battered, bruised, and on the brink of destruction, Goku finds himself at the mercy of Tien Shinhan, as the final match in the World Martial Arts Tournament continues. No one has witnessed combat like this! Who will win the ultimate battle? Watch and find out!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206776.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":30,\"absoluteNumber\":98,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:51\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206777,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tien's Insurrection\",\"aired\":\"1988-02-03\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Tien's power and technique seem to be amazingly equal, but a dramatic turn of events enrages Tien to a new level of focus and determination. Only one outcome will satisfy the proud Tien as he unveils a sinister new attack! How can Goku survive against this monstrous new Tien?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206777.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":31,\"absoluteNumber\":99,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:54\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206778,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Spirit Cannon\",\"aired\":\"1988-02-10\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"With his surprising multi-armed technique, Tien launches a furious assault on Goku. He seems to have the advantage, but Goku's tail proves to be more trouble than expected and Goku breaks free. As the fight ensues, Tien grows desperate enough to unleash the Tri-Beam Cannon, a powerful attack that could destroy them both!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206778.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":32,\"absoluteNumber\":100,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:58:57\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206779,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Fallen\",\"aired\":\"1988-02-17\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Having barely escaped the devastating tri-beam attack, Goku and Tien are now high above the stadium. Goku's surprise use of the Kamehameha Wave leaves both fighters helplessly falling and, with the ring destroyed, the first one to hit the ground loses. Due to a collision with a truck, Goku hits the ground first and Tien is declared the winner. As former rivals become friends and celebrate a well fought tournament, a mysterious enemy's attack steals a friend's life.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206779.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":33,\"absoluteNumber\":101,\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"22nd Tenkaichi Budokai Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:01\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206780,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Enter King Piccolo\",\"aired\":\"1988-02-24\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Krillin is dead! As Goku sets out on a quest for revenge, his friends attempt to learn the identity of Krllin's killer. All clues lead to Master Roshi's past an evil, that could destroy the world!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206780.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":102,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:13\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206781,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tambourine Attacks!\",\"aired\":\"1988-03-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku catches up with the killer. The killer is a demon named Tambourine and gladly tells Goku about how he kills Krillin for the dragonball and lists of the martial arts society. Tambourine beats up Goku by blasting a beam at the flying nimbus causing Goku to fall into the woods. Tambourine beats the crud out of Goku and continues going back to King Piccolo thinking he is dead. Meanwhile back at the martial arts tournament the gang decides to go back to Kami Island with Krillin`s dead body. Tambourine gets back to King Piccolo. Piccolo tells Tambourine   to post the  martial arts society pictures on the wall. Piccolo   commands Tambourine to go and kill the entire martial arts society to make sure no one can use the evil containment wave and trap King Piccolo in the electric jar again. Tambourine goes and kills King Chapa and Pamfoot.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206781.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":103,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:16\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206782,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Mark of the Demon\",\"aired\":\"1988-03-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Tambourine continues his killing rampage by killing Bacterian and Manwolf. Back at the Kame house Master Roshie and the gang think of a plan to defeat King Piccolo using the Daragonballs   and to make a freezing capsule to perserve Krilllin`s body for another year. King Piccolo creates another demon called Cymbal to   get the dragonballs. Goku wakes up trying to find food. He finds a fish cooking above a fire and decides to eat it. A boulder is thrown at him. Goku dodges the boulder and threatens the stranger to come out. The stranger comes out claiming that Goku stole his fish.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206782.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":104,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:19\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206783,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Here Comes Yajirobe\",\"aired\":\"1988-03-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The stranger tells Goku that he stole his Breakfast. Goku says that can he prove it was his fish. The stranger tells Goku that he was cooking that fish. Goku sees that the stranger has a dragonball hanging on his neck as a bracelet. Goku then thinks that he works with Tambourine and they start fightingn him. After they are done fighting Goku asks the stranger`s name. The stranger says his name is Yajirobe and Goku tells his own name.   Goku asks where Yajirobe got the dragonball. Yajirobe says that he found it 3 years ago in the jungle. Goku realizes that the whole fight was a misunderstanding. Then Cymbal comes asking for the dragonball. Goku relaizes that Cymbal works with Tambourine. Yajirobe doesn`t give up his dragonball and fights him. Right when Cymbal was going to use his killer attack Yajirobe grabs his sword and cuts Cymbal in half. King Piccolo finds out about Cymbal`s death telephatically linked and starts to have a killer headacke.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206783.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":105,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:22\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206784,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Terrible Tambourine\",\"aired\":\"1988-03-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Tambourine continues his seek-and-slaughter campagign of Martial Artists as he sets his sight on victom number eight! Yamcha! Master Roshi takes Tien and Chiaotzu on a cross-country race for the Dragon Balls. As they try to stay ahead of the competion, King Piccolo and his dastardly horde. Meanwhile Goku attempts to persuade mountain-boy Yajirobe to hand over his Dragon Ball to help save Krillin!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206784.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":106,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:25\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206785,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tien's Atonement\",\"aired\":\"1988-04-06\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Tambourine closes in on Goku and Yajirobe as the two warriors enrage in a cross-country chase for each other. Meanwhile to obtain a Dragon Ball, Tien Shinhan must first atone for the brutality of his past.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206785.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":107,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:29\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206786,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Revenge\",\"aired\":\"1988-04-13\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Tambourine arrives to exact revenge on the murderer of his 'brother' Cymbal.  Goku tells Yajirobe that it is his turn to fight, and Yajirobe consents, as long as he can eat the monster.   Tambourine laughs and can't believe that Goku wants to challenge him again.  Goku says that he'll win this time because he is full and not hungry.  Goku then beats the living tar out of Tambourine.  Tambourine appears dead, but gets up and fires an energy ball at Goku.  It appears to have incinerated Goku, but Goku was too fast for it.   Tambourine tries to fly away, but Goku uses his power pole to propel himself upwards and powers up a Kamehameha.  He then incinerates Tambourine.   King Piccolo feels Tambourine's death through his mental link and goes to avenge his death himself.  The episode ends as Pilaf's airship appears in the skies above Goku and Yajirobe.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206786.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":7,\"absoluteNumber\":108,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:32\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206787,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku vs. King Piccolo\",\"aired\":\"1988-04-20\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku must stand alone as he faces the wrath of King Piccolo. Without aid, and protecting the one-star Dragon Ball. Goku defends his life as the dastardly alien seeks revenge for the deaths of Cymbal and Tambourine. Master Roshi finds himslf between a rock and a hard place as he quests for the three-star ball.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206787.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":8,\"absoluteNumber\":109,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:36\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206788,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Piccolo Closes In\",\"aired\":\"1988-05-04\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Exhausted, bruised and alone, Goku makes a final stand against the seemingly indestructable King Piccolo. As Master Roshi and the others continue their pursuit of the Dragon Balls, it becomes clear that the trail leads to the dark forces of Piccolo and judgement day for our heros.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206788.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":9,\"absoluteNumber\":110,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:39\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206789,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Roshi's Gambit\",\"aired\":\"1988-05-11\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Global destruction is one wish away if King Piccolo succeeds in calling forth the Eternal Dragon. Master Roshi answers the call for a hero by placing himself between the creature and the remaining Dragon Balls. However, in his attempt to save the world, he may pay the ultimate price.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206789.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":10,\"absoluteNumber\":111,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:42\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206790,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"King Piccolo's Wish\",\"aired\":\"1988-05-18\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"King Piccolo has called forth the Eternal Dragon. Master Roshi is down, Tien can't get up and Chiaotzu is scared stiff. With no one to oppose him, Piccolo prepares to make a wish, which if granted, could become the world's greatest nightmare!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206790.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":11,\"absoluteNumber\":112,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:45\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206791,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Siege on Chow Castle\",\"aired\":\"1988-05-25\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The invasion has begun! A youthful King Piccolo sets out to vanquish the world, sector by sector, and he's starting out with the peaceful inhabitants of King Furry's realm! Meanwhile, Goku hopes to regain his strength by visiting Master Korin's Tower, if he can climb it, exhausted and frail.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206791.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":12,\"absoluteNumber\":113,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:48\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206792,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Conquest and Power\",\"aired\":\"1988-06-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's reunion with Master Korin is filled with hope and disappointment as the hero receives shocking news! Meanwhile King Piccolo attempts to force King Furry's obedience through a horrific display of brutality towards his kingdom and subjects as Tien prepares for the long journey to learn the secret of the Evil Containment Wave.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206792.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":13,\"absoluteNumber\":114,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:51\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206793,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Awaken Darkness\",\"aired\":\"1988-06-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Something stirs in the cold, deep black below. Moans bellow from a hollow cavern beneath the ice. The Dark is alive! And it calls for Goku, as he sets out on a dangerous quest to find the Ultra Divine Water. One sip could mean amazing power or painful death!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206793.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":14,\"absoluteNumber\":115,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:55\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206794,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"A Taste of Destiny\",\"aired\":\"1988-06-22\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Yajirobe seek the Ultra Divine Water, a mystical beverage that will grant either great power or death. But surprise follows surprise as Goku finally finds Darkness, the keeper of the Ultra Divine Water. After Goku proves himself worthy, Darkness allows him to drink the perilous potion. But will he be empowered or perish?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206794.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":15,\"absoluteNumber\":116,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 12:59:58\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206795,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Ultimate Sacrifice\",\"aired\":\"1988-06-29\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Tien masters the Evil Containment Wave, deciding to use it against the evil Piccolo. One problem; if used against an opponent the Wave will kill its user! Meanwhile Goku and Yajirobe return to Korin's Tower where Goku discovers his new powers and is given another Nimbus cloud. Can Goku reach Piccolo before Tien sacrifices himself?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206795.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":16,\"absoluteNumber\":117,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:01\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206796,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Prelude to Vengeance\",\"aired\":\"1988-07-06\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"King Piccolo has declared annihilation of the world, one sector at a time. First up, the Western City, home of Bulma's parents. Tien Shinhan, having mastered the Evil Containment Wave, prepares to fight Piccolo, but a new menace threatens all. Goku races to offer aid, but will it be too late?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206796.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":17,\"absoluteNumber\":118,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:05\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206797,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Battle Cry\",\"aired\":\"1988-07-20\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"There's a new beast in town and his name is Drum. Tien Shinhan must go through him before he can fight King Piccolo. The problem is, Drum moves faster than Tien's eyes - all three of them! Goku is on his way, but will he arrive in time to save the day?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206797.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":18,\"absoluteNumber\":119,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:08\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206798,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku Strikes Back\",\"aired\":\"1988-07-27\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku is back to face King Piccolo, and not a moment too soon! As Tien Shinhan and the rest of the resistance endure their most desperate hour, only Goku stands between Piccolo and the destruction of the Western City. It's more than just a rematch, it's the battle to save the world!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206798.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":19,\"absoluteNumber\":120,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:11\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206799,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Biggest Crisis\",\"aired\":\"1988-08-03\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Piccolo puts all of West City on edge when he invades the King's castle, but Goku is not about to let him take over without a fight. While Tien watches from the sidelines, the young Saiyan takes it on the chin and refuses to go down. It's a fierce battle but even Goku has his limits. How much can he take?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206799.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":20,\"absoluteNumber\":121,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:14\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206800,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Final Showdown\",\"aired\":\"1988-08-10\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The fierce fight between Goku and Piccolo continues. But Piccolo gains the advantage when he breaks Goku down limb by limb. To make matters worse, Tien is used as a pawn in the battle. Goku is forced to make an awful choice. Will he surrender to Piccolo and save his friend or choose to fight and risk his own life?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206800.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":21,\"absoluteNumber\":122,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:17\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206801,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Lost and Found\",\"aired\":\"1988-08-17\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"With Piccolo's reign of terror at an end, Goku has time to mend his wounds. As he heals he learns that there may be a way to revive his lost friends - a face to face meeting with the creator of the Dragonballs! The only problem is that the only way to get to the mysterious Kami is by using his Power Pole, and it's gone missing!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206801.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":22,\"absoluteNumber\":123,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:20\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206802,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Temple Above the Clouds\",\"aired\":\"1988-08-24\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku finds his lost Power Pole and uses it to climb to Kami's temple in the sky. The only problem is that when he arrives he must face off against Kami's assistant Mr. Popo in a test of strength. Does Goku have what it takes to pass this test and earn a meeting with the mysterious Kami?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206802.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":23,\"absoluteNumber\":124,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:24\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206803,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Earth's Guardian Emerges\",\"aired\":\"1988-08-31\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku cannot defeat Mr. Popo, and thus, cannot see Kami!  Goku decides to be trained by Popo.  Kami eventually does reveal himself, and Goku is shocked to see he looks just like Piccolo(the logic!)!  Kami tells Goku of how he split his good self from his bad in order to take the throne of Kami-sama, but because of it, Piccolo was created.  Kami tells Goku that he can't bring the dead back to life... but Shenron can.  He will be able to bring Shenron back to life to restore everyone.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206803.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":24,\"absoluteNumber\":125,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:28\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206804,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Eternal Dragon Resurrected\",\"aired\":\"1988-09-14\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"After Goku mistakes Kami for the villainous Piccolo it is time for the young warrior to begin his grueling three year training for the next World Martial Arts Tournament. In exchange for Goku's promise Kami agrees to revive the Eternal Dragon!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206804.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":25,\"absoluteNumber\":126,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:31\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206805,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Quicker Than Lightning\",\"aired\":\"1988-09-21\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's first task under his new teacher is a death-defying mission to the top of Mount Rumble to fetch the legendary Sacred Crown. But the mystical artifact has a deadly secret! Goku will have to be quicker than lightning to accomplish this task alive!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206805.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":26,\"absoluteNumber\":127,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:34\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206806,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Secret of the Woods\",\"aired\":\"1988-09-28\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Continuing his training, Goku follows Popo's instruction and enters the deep, dark woods. While searching for a worthy sparring partner, Goku stumbles across a surprising discovery hidden deep within the secluded labyrinth and finds help a most unexpected way!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206806.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":27,\"absoluteNumber\":128,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:37\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206807,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Time Room\",\"aired\":\"1988-10-12\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku journeys through time, where he meets a young Master Roshi! But Roshi has a problem of his own his arch rival, Shen! While the two rivals battle for the affections of the same girl, Goku attempts a new power with the help of Master Mutaito.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206807.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":28,\"absoluteNumber\":129,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:41\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206808,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Doll?\",\"aired\":\"1988-10-19\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Be careful what you wish for. You just might get it!? Goku learns this lesson the hard way when he asks Popo for the ultimate sparring partner to aid in his training. What he gets is the battle of his life! Meanwhile, Yamcha and the others continue their long journey to reach Korin's Tower, in hopes of receiving training from the wise Master.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206808.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":29,\"absoluteNumber\":130,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:43\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206809,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Walking Their Own Ways\",\"aired\":\"1988-10-26\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Preparing for the World Martial Arts Tournament, Goku gets some important training tips from Mr. Popo. Meanwhile, Tien, Yamcha, Chaiotzu and Krillin make their way to Korin's Tower for some training of their own. Unfortunately they are sidetracked by a village celebrating a mysterious festival to their mountain spirit. Once the mountain erupts it's up to our heroes to put a lid on the active volcano!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206809.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":30,\"absoluteNumber\":131,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:47\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206810,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Hotter Than Lava\",\"aired\":\"1988-11-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"While Goku continues his training, Tien, Yamcha, Chiaotzu and Krillin find themselves in a very hot situation! A remote village is threatened by an erupting volcano and it's up to the good guys to put a lid on it. The time has come to put their new training to the test!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206810.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":31,\"absoluteNumber\":132,\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"King Piccolo Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:00:50\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206811,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Changes\",\"aired\":\"1988-11-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Warriors the world over are lining up to compete as the World Martial Arts Tournament prepares to get under way. Unfortunately, all of Master Roshi's pupils are missing, including Goku. With the entry-deadline approaching, the competitive future of our heroes looks bleak, as does Roshi's patience.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206811.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":133,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:02\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206812,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Preliminary Peril\",\"aired\":\"1988-11-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The World Martial Arts Tournament gets underway as Goku and the others compete in the exciting preliminary round. But the competition threatens to turn ugly when Goku gets a visit from an old adversary.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206812.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":134,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:05\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206813,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Battle of Eight\",\"aired\":\"1988-11-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The preliminary round continues as Goku, Yamcha, Krillin, and Tien battle one opponent after another in hopes of advancing to the semi-final round. Meanwhile, Master Roshi is confronted by an old rival.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206813.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":135,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:09\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206814,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Tien Shinhan vs Mercenary Tao\",\"aired\":\"1988-11-30\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The match between Tien Shinhan and Mercenary Tao begins. Shen (the Crane hermit) is in the audience cheering for his brother Tao. Tien seems to be a lot stronger than Tao and tries to escort    him out of the ring until Tao takes off one of his cybernetic hands revealing a knife. The announcer tells Tao that he is disqualified for using a weapon but Tao dosen`t lisen because he wants to kill Tien for deciding to join the Turtle Hermit`s students. Tien breaks the knife. Tao takes off his other hand revealing a cannon for his super Dodon ray. Tao shoots the super Dodon ray at Tien. Tien survives the ray easily by being able to destroy it. Tien punches Tao in the stomach. Tien gives Tao to Shen. Shen and Tao leave the tournament saying that the Turtle Hermit and his students won`t die in peace. And Goku and Anomounous`s match is about to begin.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206814.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":136,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:12\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206815,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Anonymous Proposal\",\"aired\":\"1988-12-07\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku battles the unknown girl, who seems to be getting more and more angry at him.  Eventually, she tells him why she's angry at him:  Goku told her he'd marry her!  After a funny scene in which Goku finally learns what getting married means, he tells her he doesn't even recall saying this to her.  She then tells him that she'll tell him who she is, but only if he defeats her.  With that said, Goku easilly knocks her out of the ring.  Defeated, the girl reveals that she's Chi Chi(which Oolong already figured out).  Goku then realizes that he did promise to marry her, but he admits that he always thought that \\\"\\\"married\\\"\\\" was some sort of food.  Chi Chi is sad, but then is overjoyed when Goku proposes to her right in the ring.  She then kisses him(which makes Krillin angry).  Soon, the next battle begins:  Ma Junior(Piccolo) vs. Krillin.  The two seem to be even, but Piccolo decides to show Krillin some of his true strength...\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206815.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":137,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:15\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206816,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Mysterious Hero\",\"aired\":\"1988-12-14\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"With some difficulty, Junior defeats Krillin, even though it looked as though they were evenly matched. Then, Yamcha faces Hero, who is really Kami, using the human to defeat Piccolo Jr.. Does Yamcha have a chance?\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206816.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":6,\"absoluteNumber\":138,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:17\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206817,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Rematch\",\"aired\":\"1988-12-21\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Hero starts by acting like a crazy man, however, Yamcha scratches to stay in the ring as Hero reveals his true abilityand identity. Goku and Tien Shinhan must fight one another in a friendly rematch to claim the last remaining spot for the semi-finals.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206817.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":7,\"absoluteNumber\":139,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:21\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1988\"},{\"id\":206818,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku Gains Speed\",\"aired\":\"1989-01-11\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As the battle between Tien Shinhan and Goku rages, Goku unloads a heavy burden, one that may shift the balance in the extraordinary showdown. All eyes turn to Tien as an embarrassing moment spurs him to make a dangerous choice.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206818.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":8,\"absoluteNumber\":140,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:24\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206819,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Four Faces of Tien\",\"aired\":\"1989-01-18\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku has always been able to handle himself in the ring, but when his fight with Tien Shinhan turns into a war against an army, he finds himself in serious jeopardy. Tien's new technique may spell the end for our hero!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206819.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":9,\"absoluteNumber\":141,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:27\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206820,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Kami vs Piccolo\",\"aired\":\"1989-01-25\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku is eager to fight Junior, but Kami fears his inexperience will be his downfall. Hero takes on Junior in the last round of the semi-finals, where his shocking agenda is revealed.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206820.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":10,\"absoluteNumber\":142,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:31\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206821,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Battle for the Future\",\"aired\":\"1989-02-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku faces the ultimate test as he confronts his greatest nemesis in the final round of tournament. This time his fight is for more than the title. The future of the free world is at stake!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206821.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":11,\"absoluteNumber\":143,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:34\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206822,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Super Kamehameha\",\"aired\":\"1989-02-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The battle to save the planet continues as Goku tries to take down Junior in the final match of the 23rd World Martial Arts Tournament. Goku has an ultimate weapon: The Super Kamehameha Wave. However, if he uses it to destroy Junior, Kami will be sacrificed, having been trapped inside Junior's stomach!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206822.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":12,\"absoluteNumber\":144,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:38\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206823,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Junior no More\",\"aired\":\"1989-02-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Junior reveals a startling secret that shocks the tournament. Goku finds himself facing a huge dilemma, as his fight for the championship becomes the fight for survival!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206823.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":13,\"absoluteNumber\":145,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:40\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206824,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku's Trap\",\"aired\":\"1989-02-22\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"As the exhausting battle between Goku and Junior continues, Goku avoids disaster by taking the battle within. Junior surprises all when he unveils a new threat!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206824.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":14,\"absoluteNumber\":146,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:43\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206825,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Goku Hangs On\",\"aired\":\"1989-03-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The World Martial Arts Tournament begins to fall to pieces as Junior unveils a technique that not only threatens to destroy Goku, but his friends as well. Even the mighty Kami believes that there is no way for Goku to survive in this winner-take-all massacre!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206825.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":15,\"absoluteNumber\":147,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:47\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206826,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Victor\",\"aired\":\"1989-03-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The end of the 23rd World Martial Arts Tournament finds Goku struggling for survival as Junior gets the upper hand, poised to take the Title and his life. Kami devises a way to rescue the young hero, but his plan calls for the ultimate sacrifice!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206826.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":16,\"absoluteNumber\":148,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:50\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206827,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Dress in Flames\",\"aired\":\"1989-03-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Eager to announce their wedding plans, Goku and Chi Chi return to her father's kingdom. The good news is short-lived when Ox King's castle goes up in flames! Goku embarks on a quest to find a sacred tool, which can save Ox King and his future with Chi Chi.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206827.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":17,\"absoluteNumber\":149,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:53\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206828,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The Fire-Eater\",\"aired\":\"1989-03-22\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and ChiChi's search for the Basho Fan leads them into the heart of a fiery volcano. Once inside, they must face a mighty creature that consumes flames: the Fire-Eater!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206828.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":18,\"absoluteNumber\":150,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:01:56\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206829,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Outrageous Octagon\",\"aired\":\"1989-04-05\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku's search for the Basho fan leads him to a treacherous mountain that has a strange curse. ChiChi is faced with the biggest mess of her life when she meets a mysterious old woman, while the Ox King tries to flee the raging fires that threaten to destroy his castle!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206829.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":19,\"absoluteNumber\":151,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:02:00\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206830,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"Mystery of the Dark World\",\"aired\":\"1989-04-12\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"After the Basho fan fails to put out the fire threatening the Ox King, Goku and ChiChi set out to find the Magical Furnace, believed to be the last hope for extinguishing the deadly blaze. But before they can complete their quest, Goku must solve the mystery of the Dark World.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206830.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":20,\"absoluteNumber\":152,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:02:03\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1989\"},{\"id\":206831,\"seriesId\":76666,\"name\":\"The End, The Beginning\",\"aired\":\"1989-04-19\",\"runtime\":25,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Goku and Chi Chi must travel to Mt. Five Elements in a last ditch effort to save her father, the Ox King, from the deadly magical flames, which threaten to consume his kingdom. Before Goku can complete his quest, he must fan the flames of Fate and hope he doesn't get burned!\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/76666/206831.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":21,\"absoluteNumber\":153,\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Piccolo Jr. Saga\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-04 13:02:06\",\"finaleType\":\"series\",\"year\":\"1989\"}],\"overview\":\"山奥で一人で暮らしていた少年・孫悟空の前に、ブルマという女の子が現れた。ブルマは七つ揃えればどんな願いでも叶うというドラゴンボールを探して、世界中を旅していたのだ。今は亡きじいちゃんの遺した不思議な宝珠、それこそがドラゴンボールだったことから、二人の冒険の旅が始まった！　武天老師こと亀仙人、牛魔王と娘のチチ、変身が得意なウーロン、砂漠の盗賊ヤムチャとウーロン…様々な出会いと冒険を繰り返しながら、悟空はドラゴンボールを集めてゆく。ドラゴンボールの力を使って世界征服を企むピラフ一味の野望も、ウーロンの機転（？）によって阻止された。石になって再び世界中に散らばっていったドラゴンボールが、力を取り戻すのは一年後。悟空は今よりもっと強くなるため、小坊主のクリリンと共に、亀仙人のもとで修行に励むことになる。\",\"year\":\"1986\"},\"links\":{\"prev\":null,\"self\":\"https://api4.thetvdb.com/v4/series/76666/episodes/official/eng?page=0\",\"next\":null,\"total_items\":159,\"page_size\":500}}\n"